        },
        {
          "text": " Kisha, Zera Mkushi alikuja kuwashambulia akiwa na jeshi la watu milioni moja na magari mia tatu akaja Maresha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.9",
